{"run_id":"demo-po1003-granite","seq":13,"ts":"2026-10-24T11:14:38Z","type":"answer","payload":{"text":"Order PO-1003 can run at the sealing temperature limit because the critical temperature thresholds for the sealing station (ST02_SEALING) are defined as NOMINAL 185.0±1.2 °C, with a CRIT_HI of 210.0 °C. The temperature sensor used at this station is supplied by ThermoSense GmbH (TMP-2210).","justification":"The order PO-1003 is executed at the sealing station ST02_SEALING (edge 68dff3af3f55). The temperature limits for this station are given in RULE-THR-ST02-TMP-CRIT (edges 79e2a13dac58 and 29dcfd3b3f64), which apply to the temperature sensor TMP-2210 (edge 76b1a8f75577). The sensor is supplied by ThermoSense GmbH (edge 2151832c7759).","citations":[{"edge_id":"68dff3af3f55","chunk_id":null},{"edge_id":"79e2a13dac58","chunk_id":null},{"edge_id":"29dcfd3b3f64","chunk_id":null},{"edge_id":"2151832c7759","chunk_id":null}],"contradictions":[],"canary":null}}
